#
# The C++ half of espos_flow (this directory and include/espos_flow/) is
# written in Google style -- 2-space indent, `Type* p`, 80 columns -- like
# espos_n2k, espos_voice and espos_audio. The C half (src/, include/*.h) keeps
# the 4-space IDF look of the root .clang-format; clang-format uses the
# nearest file, which is why the two halves sit in different directories.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Include order is deliberate: the component's own header first, then the
# espOS headers it depends on, then the system and IDF ones. Google's
# regrouping would move e.g. "espos_flow.h" below <cstdint>; never reorder.
SortIncludes: Never
